<title>USA: WPS Resources Corp Q4 net off.</title>
<headline>WPS Resources Corp Q4 net off.</headline>
<dateline>GREEN BAY, Wis. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.17		    $0.57</p>
<p> Net			  3,730		   13,507</p>
<p> Revs		     246,309		  203,236</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  23,885		   23,897</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q4 includes a $4 million loss on an industrial processing facility investment and decreased margins as WPS Energy Services Inc of $4.8 million due to volatile gas market prices.  </p>
<p>			YEAR</p>
<p> Shr		 $2.00		    $2.32</p>
<p> Net		 47,755		    55,343</p>
<p> Revs		 858,254		  719,848</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  23,891		    23,897</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 year and Q4 results included increased operating expenses of $4.5 million at Wisconsin Public Service Corp as the utility expands certain operating activities in anticipation of a deregulated energy marketplace.</p>
<p>The 1996 net decrease included increased operating expenses at the non-regulated subsidiaries of about $7.1 million relating primarily to expansion and infrastructure development.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
